r (CPDC) will work with you, your professors, and local, regional and national employers to provide you with the career preparation skills, internship opportunities and placement services you need to get where you’re going. And if you’re not sure yet where you’re headed – the CPDC can help with that, too, by helping you to decide on a major or graduate program that fits your plans for the future. Just like the benefits of your Seton Hill education, CPDC services don’t end with graduation. As a Seton Hill alumni, the CPDC is here for you if you decide you want to change, advance or enhance your career. View the Class of 2025 Post-Graduation First Destination Survey Report (PDF) here. In This Section Career & Professional Development Center Career Services for Students Alumni Career Services Employer Services Seton Hill Career Team Success Stories Postgraduate Success Highlights Places Seton Hill Alumni Work Schools Where Alumni Continue Their Education We're Here to Help! For more information about the Career and Professional Development Center, please call us at (724) 838-4276. Seton Hill University 1 Seton Hill Drive, Greensburg, PA 15601 (800) 826-6234 MySHU Bookstore Library & Learning Center Offices Campus Safety Contact Us Employment Consumer Information Privacy Policy Give to Seton Hill Â© 2026 Seton Hill University. All rights reserved."
